{"title":"The Offer"}
</properties>
<content>
<callout icon="💰" color="gray_bg">
	Know this cold. Every part of what we install, the proof, and the compliance lines. When a prospect asks what they get, you don't hesitate.
</callout>
## What The Grid Is
The Grid is a done-with-you install of the exact AI multi-account content system Kaden runs, the one pulling \~100M views a month on autopilot. We don't hand people a course. We build the machine with them so their reach lives across hundreds of accounts instead of on one account they could lose tomorrow.
- **Phone / device build** — the physical setup that runs many accounts at once.
- **Account-creation engine** — how the network of accounts gets built and scaled.
- **AI distribution layer** — the automation that pushes content across the whole network on autopilot, so it runs without them posting by hand.
- **Done-with-you buildout + support** — we set it up with them, not just tell them how, plus the community in Discord.
	## What We Install
The outcome we sell: distribution they own and reach that survives bans, no single account decides whether they eat.
## Who It's For
Agencies and operators who need reach at scale and can't afford to get wiped by a ban. Full detail on the Ideal Customer Profile (ICP) Cheatsheet.
## The Proof
- Kaden runs the system to \~\$100k/month across a large account network, \~100M views/month on autopilot.
- He built it back after a ban wiped \~\$70k/month overnight. The comeback is the proof the model works.
## The Investment
The Grid is a done-with-you install priced to the scale of the operation. The closer sets the investment on the call based on what the prospect is running and what they can put behind it, it is not a fixed low-ticket number. Payments run through Fanbasis, and payment plans are available. Setters qualify with buckets and framing, the closer owns the price.
<callout icon="🛡️" color="red_bg">
	Compliance: never say ban-proof, undetectable, or guaranteed. We sell resilience and distribution, not immunity, accounts can and do get banned, that's the whole reason the system exists. Never promise a prospect a view count or a dollar figure. Every proof number is Kaden's or a verified client's. "Results vary."
</callout>
</content>
